  {
    "id": "cb442a5d60d8688eb9c2",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/0/name",
    "source": "Path of the Totem Warrior",
    "sourceHash": "d04b9c3e1cd77f672affe18a86c4681629fd76227e1e922e1ce8844a22c419c7"
  },
  {
    "id": "fae6e4c0c234d3c7e57d",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/0/desc",
    "source": "A barbarian who takes a beast as a spirit guide, borrowing its strengths in and out of a rage.",
    "sourceHash": "8f2cf8792020c4c38af91d34aa15f1817dfb56b6850b7f3327072c050e70c10d"
  },
  {
    "id": "3f5e44236a1f26e2b4e8",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/0/levels/3/0/n",
    "source": "Spirit Seeker",
    "sourceHash": "bf01ef1bf9d66c03fac32dc7db040d9d0d35550a6efcf810ba5ef07d98ee632b"
  },
  {
    "id": "0e6c20871cf440ab5a82",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/0/levels/3/0/d",
    "source": "Ritual casting of beast sense and speak with animals.",
    "sourceHash": "369bf128b247c1f848582717a20143f924d331b33a401b2303f784be310fe7b6"
  },
  {
    "id": "54d3b34308606d5e131b",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/0/levels/3/1/n",
    "source": "Totem Spirit",
    "sourceHash": "baad803280466a9d858be98abc3d38cbccb0934fe9eb9a85f0350f5ab49ef34d"
  },
  {
    "id": "30d41b51bdb0f2848480",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/0/levels/3/1/d",
    "source": "Choose a totem, whose gift holds while you rage: Bear gives resistance to all damage but psychic; Eagle gives other creatures disadvantage on opportunity attacks against you and lets you Dash as a bonus action; Elk raises your walking speed by 15 feet; Tiger adds 10 feet to your long jump and 3 feet to your high jump; Wolf gives your allies advantage on melee attacks against any hostile creature within 5 feet of you.",
    "sourceHash": "f5599c5ebf7b8faf3adb32526b8a2d5937b6e6394904bebd8209e201271aa9bb"
  },
  {
    "id": "2305267fe6168128afe4",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/0/levels/6/0/n",
    "source": "Aspect of the Beast",
    "sourceHash": "a577fde04f021f5bdf01a2d7bb43f61d76808d03c6bcfef28b024f025a9b1289"
  },
  {
    "id": "ae8221c00eabf39be104",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/0/levels/6/0/d",
    "source": "A lasting gift from your totem: Bear doubles your carrying capacity and gives advantage on Strength checks to push, pull, lift or break; Eagle lets you see clearly up to a mile away, and dim light no longer hampers your Perception; Elk doubles the travel pace of you and up to ten companions within 60 feet of you; Tiger makes you proficient in two of Athletics, Acrobatics, Stealth and Survival; Wolf lets you track at a fast pace and move stealthily at a normal pace.",
    "sourceHash": "1303f6e4cc8e58c06697ace46ded8a04fbc21f3fd9f999331cd55d541b1a2c86"
  },
  {
    "id": "0f6e3c663b2f62f303a0",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/0/levels/10/0/n",
    "source": "Spirit Walker",
    "sourceHash": "d423cb6aff4b136c9a330902606bab4092ef98dc52cd10cd8db43726988ca0d5"
  },
  {
    "id": "4fc036a3c2488669959f",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/0/levels/10/0/d",
    "source": "Cast commune with nature as a ritual; the answer arrives as a spirit beast.",
    "sourceHash": "c827d42f18f9025ecc6dc9ec0a9cf103813ea55a6b18dd12332c0988d69bb3c4"
  },
  {
    "id": "3f4de75ec4b03f2fb63d",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/0/levels/14/0/n",
    "source": "Totemic Attunement",
    "sourceHash": "93ca7139c1282b53d69c91d2d8c604914f8d7cd7d10b7edba8f522f465110ace"
  },
  {
    "id": "33d956ab48bc117757cb",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/0/levels/14/0/d",
    "source": "While raging: Bear gives each hostile creature within 5 feet of you disadvantage on attacks against anyone but you or another with this feature; Eagle gives you a flying speed equal to your walking speed, though you fall if you end your turn in the air with nothing holding you up; Elk lets you pass through a Large or smaller creature's space as a bonus action, and it is knocked prone and takes 1d12 + your Strength modifier bludgeoning damage unless it succeeds on a Strength save (DC 8 + your proficiency bonus + your Strength modifier); Tiger lets you make one melee weapon attack as a bonus action after moving at least 20 feet straight toward a Large or smaller target; Wolf lets you knock a Large or smaller creature prone as a bonus action when you hit it with a melee weapon attack.",
    "sourceHash": "cd0dbddc0ec28ff280ffc78020bfbcf9db9a19c6ec3e93b3e0892d27423561b3"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09627ebf0eef31337cc",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/1/name",
    "source": "Path of the Ancestral Guardian",
    "sourceHash": "e27ddb289c8a2f22423dd5056e239153e535dc2c0780a4f2f5086a339771a60f"
  },
  {
    "id": "d5e7b11db8122961adfe",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/1/desc",
    "source": "Ancestral spirits answer this barbarian's rage and shield the people fighting beside them.",
    "sourceHash": "512f25945e52567af08ccdabbfc7d35bea23a56c4489c4181d25030e5d24fca4"
  },
  {
    "id": "470152c4efbc95049bdc",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/1/levels/3/0/n",
    "source": "Ancestral Protectors",
    "sourceHash": "85a4a86b52845aecc0ba6e0594108b1acf6e067209b02069045427e315c46241"
  },
  {
    "id": "8367153fa6b1d1f7fb75",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/1/levels/3/0/d",
    "source": "While raging, the first creature you hit on each of your turns has disadvantage on attack rolls against anyone but you until the start of your next turn or until your rage ends, and when it hits a creature other than you, that creature has resistance to the attack's damage.",
    "sourceHash": "d04ba599997ddfb879b3508127ec73f40917fecba6796449296e7f794f0993c5"
  },
  {
    "id": "288cc1215c5020aef569",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/1/levels/6/0/n",
    "source": "Spirit Shield",
    "sourceHash": "858c3d54921fc0c5bfd26a7b92bc2f843bc41e37846f8cf2749a5358445836c5"
  },
  {
    "id": "69475db5a9c525cff868",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/1/levels/6/0/d",
    "source": "While raging, a reaction reduces damage to an ally you can see within 30 feet by 2d6, rising to 3d6 at 10th level and 4d6 at 14th.",
    "sourceHash": "bd4e0f7cfac9845ab3b811b141ef1f81cd7365ab23a7b7b322e8ea1b92b9f4e6"
  },
  {
    "id": "bead6e0961f86a32dc20",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/1/levels/10/0/n",
    "source": "Consult the Spirits",
    "sourceHash": "d73c884f7a26a1bd02dfa9a33f139b9b7119c89f45a490be2e0cce842b4cac7c"
  },
  {
    "id": "8830f69176029aa4428c",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/1/levels/10/0/d",
    "source": "Cast augury or clairvoyance once per short or long rest, using Wisdom, without a slot or components.",
    "sourceHash": "d4e034b350c24f12ccd346752198f9b8962eb966bde8d9c5bac525f99e404753"
  },
  {
    "id": "c19f80888f88f163885a",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/1/levels/14/0/n",
    "source": "Vengeful Ancestors",
    "sourceHash": "0a550477621f805b822d0e8881fe6e0f1f7d1e08913865d96955dc9fb40a3c4f"
  },
  {
    "id": "59d4fa2d2fb8e11bb337",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/1/levels/14/0/d",
    "source": "Damage prevented by Spirit Shield is dealt straight back to the attacker as force damage.",
    "sourceHash": "08598bfd78abc6b365fecc8be122c0e575d8d7b085565008e0ea9d7f323b71c7"
  },
  {
    "id": "71d9a1d7fc7f4c5f6786",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
